(7, 'Tshirt', 'SKU-4', NULL, NULL, 'product/featureImage/L2FwaS9qd3QvY29udmVyc2F0aW9uLzUyNTE0MTAvZmlsZXMvQXR0YWNobWVudF82OTUyMTY0YzJkYmViNi40MTk4MzI2Ny5wbmc=_20260101120451.png', 'Active', NULL, '2026-01-01 06:34:51', '2026-01-01 06:34:51'),
(8, 'Tshirt', 'SKU-5', NULL, NULL, 'product/featureImage/L2FwaS9qd3QvY29udmVyc2F0aW9uLzUyNTE0MTAvZmlsZXMvQXR0YWNobWVudF82OTUyMTY0YzJkYmViNi40MTk4MzI2Ny5wbmc=_20260101121303.png', 'Active', NULL, '2026-01-01 06:43:03', '2026-01-01 06:43:03'),
(9, 'Tshirt', 'SKU-6', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Active', NULL, '2026-01-01 14:58:42', '2026-01-01 14:58:42'),
(14, 'tea bag', 'SKU - 9', NULL, 'Long Description', 'product/featureImage/screencapture-myconstituency-in-2025-12-31-20_39_24_20260101170030.png', 'Active', '\"{\\\"data\\\":[[\\\"Label\\\",\\\"Value\\\"],[\\\"Label 1\\\",\\\"Value 1\\\"]],\\\"mergeCells\\\":[]}\"', '2026-01-01 17:00:30', '2026-01-01 17:00:30'),
(15, 'nothign', 'SKU-8', 'RARH-Series Lightweight, Hollow Hydraulic Cylinders are hollow and double-acting to exert both pull and push with hydraulic force. RARH Cylinders include a steel base plate and bolt-on hardened steel removable saddle.', '<p><strong>Model: RARH302\r\n</strong></p><p>\r\n</p><p>Series: RARH\r\n</p><p>Product Lines: Industrial Tools\r\n</p><p><ul><li>Lighter and shorter collapsed height than equivalent RACH models\r\n</li><li>Double-acting for rapid retraction, regardless of hose lengths or system losses\r\n</li><li>Built-in safety valve prevents accidental over-pressurization\r\n</li><li>Hollow plunger design allows for both pull and push forces\r\n</li><li>Hard coat finish on all surfaces resists damage and extends cylinder life\r\n</li><li>Handles and CR400 couplers with dust caps included on all models\r\n</li><li>Floating center tube increases seal life\r\n</li><li>Steel baseplate and saddle for protection against load-induced damage\r\n</li><li>Integral stop ring prevents plunger over-travel and is capable of withstanding the full cylinder capacity</li></ul></p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p>', 'product/featureImage/screenshot_17_20260102065103.png', 'Active', '\"{\\\"data\\\":[[\\\"Label\\\",\\\"Value\\\"],[\\\"label 1\\\",\\\"value 1\\\"]],\\\"mergeCells\\\":[]}\"', '2026-01-01 17:20:34', '2026-01-02 06:51:55'),
(23, 'HCR502, 50 ton Capacity, 50mm Stroke, Double-Acting, High Tonnage Hydraulic Cylinder', 'SKU 321', 'HCR Series Hydraulic Cylinders are double-acting which delivers a faster and more controlled return of the plunger compared to load/gravity return equivalents.riverlake High-Tonnage Cylinders are equipped with numerous special features to ensure the durability, safety, and performance needed for large-scale construction projects. Among these features are low-wear high-', '<p>Model: HCR502\r\n</p><p>Series: HCR\r\n</p><p>Product Lines: Industrial Tools\r\n</p><p><ol><li>Double-acting for fast and controlled advance and retract\r\n</li><li>Nitrocarburized surface resists side-loading and cyclic wear\r\n</li><li>10% side-load resistance over full cylinder stroke\r\n</li><li>Weather protected, inside and out\r\n</li><li>Upper and lower replaceable bearings support the plunger throughout the stroke\r\n</li><li>Certified lifting eyes\r\n</li><li>Base mounting holes\r\n</li><li>Collar threads included on models up to 250 ton. Optional on 300 ton and higher.\r\n</li><li>Maximum working pressure up to 10,000 psi (700 bar)</li></ol></p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p>', 'product/featureImage/hcr-series-double-acting-high-tonnage-hydraulic-cylinders-1_20260102112816.jpg', 'Active', '\"{\\\"data\\\":[[\\\"Model Number\\\",\\\"Capacity\\/Ton\\\",\\\"Stroke\\/mm\\\",\\\"Cylinder Effective Area\\/cm2\\\",\\\"Advance Oil Capacity\\/cm3\\\",\\\"Retract Oil Capacity\\/cm3\\\",\\\"Collapsed Height\\/mm(A)\\\",\\\"Extended Height\\/mm(B)\\\",\\\"Outside Dia\\/mm(D)\\\",\\\"Cylinder Bore Dia\\/mm(E)\\\"],[\\\"HCR502\\\",\\\"50\\\",\\\"50\\\",\\\"78.5\\\",\\\"393\\\",\\\"200\\\",\\\"183\\\",\\\"233\\\",\\\"130\\\",\\\"100\\\"],[\\\"HCR504\\\",\\\"\\\",\\\"100\\\",\\\"\\\",\\\"785\\\",\\\"401\\\",\\\"233\\\",\\\"333\\\",\\\"\\\",\\\"\\\"],[\\\"HCR506\\\",\\\"\\\",\\\"150\\\",\\\"\\\",\\\"1178\\\",\\\"601\\\",\\\"283\\\",\\\"433\\\",\\\"\\\",\\\"\\\"],[\\\"HCR508\\\",\\\"\\\",\\\"200\\\",\\\"\\\",\\\"1571\\\",\\\"801\\\",\\\"346\\\",\\\"546\\\",\\\"\\\",\\\"\\\"],[\\\"HCR5010\\\",\\\"\\\",\\\"250\\\",\\\"\\\",\\\"1963\\\",\\\"1001\\\",\\\"396\\\",\\\"646\\\",\\\"\\\",\\\"\\\"],[\\\"HCR5012\\\",\\\"\\\",\\\"300\\\",\\\"\\\",\\\"2356\\\",\\\"1202\\\",\\\"446\\\",\\\"746\\\",\\\"\\\",\\\"\\\"],[\\\"HCR1002\\\",\\\"100\\\",\\\"50\\\",\\\"143.1\\\",\\\"716\\\",\\\"361\\\",\\\"202\\\",\\\"252\\\",\\\"175\\\",\\\"135\\\"],[\\\"HCR1004\\\",\\\"\\\",\\\"100\\\",\\\"\\\",\\\"1431\\\",\\\"723\\\",\\\"252\\\",\\\"352\\\",\\\"\\\",\\\"\\\"],[\\\"HCR1006\\\",\\\"\\\",\\\"150\\\",\\\"\\\",\\\"2147\\\",\\\"1084\\\",\\\"302\\\",\\\"452\\\",\\\"\\\",\\\"\\\"],[\\\"HCR1008\\\",\\\"\\\",\\\"200\\\",\\\"\\\",\\\"2863\\\",\\\"1445\\\",\\\"379\\\",\\\"579\\\",\\\"\\\",\\\"\\\"],[\\\"HCR10010\\\",\\\"\\\",\\\"250\\\",\\\"\\\",\\\"3578\\\",\\\"1806\\\",\\\"429\\\",\\\"679\\\",\\\"\\\",\\\"\\\"],[\\\"HCR10012\\\",\\\"\\\",\\\"300\\\",\\\"\\\",\\\"4294\\\",\\\"2168\\\",\\\"479\\\",\\\"779\\\",\\\"\\\",\\\"\\\"]],\\\"mergeCells\\\":[{\\\"row\\\":1,\\\"col\\\":1,\\\"rowspan\\\":6,\\\"colspan\\\":1},{\\\"row\\\":1,\\\"col\\\":3,\\\"rowspan\\\":6,\\\"colspan\\\":1},{\\\"row\\\":7,\\\"col\\\":1,\\\"rowspan\\\":6,\\\"colspan\\\":1},{\\\"row\\\":7,\\\"col\\\":3,\\\"rowspan\\\":6,\\\"colspan\\\":1},{\\\"row\\\":12,\\\"col\\\":8,\\\"rowspan\\\":3,\\\"colspan\\\":1},{\\\"row\\\":7,\\\"col\\\":8,\\\"rowspan\\\":6,\\\"colspan\\\":1},{\\\"row\\\":7,\\\"col\\\":9,\\\"rowspan\\\":6,\\\"colspan\\\":1},{\\\"row\\\":1,\\\"col\\\":8,\\\"rowspan\\\":6,\\\"colspan\\\":1},{\\\"row\\\":1,\\\"col\\\":9,\\\"rowspan\\\":6,\\\"colspan\\\":1}]}\"', '2026-01-02 11:28:16', '2026-01-02 12:37:58'),
(26, 'Narrow Profile Hydraulic Torque Wrench', 'SKU-12312', 'The NH Series is engineered for operation in extremely confined spaces where conventional tools are impractical. Each wrench incorporates a compact, lightweight hydraulic cylinder manufactured from a high-strength aluminum–titanium alloy, providing exceptional structural integrity while reducing overall tool weight. All critical internal components are precision-machined from high-nickel alloy steel to ensure reliable performance and long service life under demanding conditions.', '<p>The series is available in six models, delivering torque outputs from 230 Nm to 101,630 Nm (approximately 170 ft·lbs to 74,970 ft·lbs) and accommodating nut sizes from 19 mm to 230 mm (3/4 inch to 9-1/16 inch). This wide operating range makes the NH Series suitable for a broad spectrum of industrial bolting applications.</p><p>Direct nut engagement ensures accurate torque transfer, enhanced operational stability, and safe, efficient handling, particularly in restricted working environments.</p><p>The NH Series power head is fully compatible with a comprehensive selection of interchangeable ratchet links, providing maximum application flexibility. Available options include the NL Narrow Profile Ratchet Link, SS Slim Ratchet Spanner Link, RS Ring Spanner Link, and OS Open Spanner Link. This modular system allows precise configuration to suit different nut geometries, sizes, and space limitations.</p><p>The NH Series operates at a maximum working pressure of 700 bar (10,000 psi) and maintains torque accuracy within ±3%.</p>', 'product/featureImage/6_png_20260202125501.png', 'Active', '\"{\\\"data\\\":[[\\\"Parameter\\\",\\\"Specification\\\"],[\\\"\\\",\\\"\\\"]],\\\"mergeCells\\\":[]}\"', '2026-02-02 07:25:01', '2026-02-02 07:25:01');

